.TH AGMEMX 1 "2026-09-22" "agmemx" "User Commands"
.nh
.SH NAME
agmemx \- beliefs and observations for a resolved directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B agmemx
[\fB--dir\fR \fIPATH\fR]
[\fB--format\fR \fIjson|text\fR]
[\fB--embed-provider\fR \fINAME\fR]
[\fB--embed-model\fR \fINAME\fR]
[\fB--embed-base-url\fR \fIURL\fR]
[\fB--embed-api-key-env\fR \fINAME\fR]
[\fB--embed-fixture\fR \fIPATH\fR]
.I command
[\fIsubcommand\fR]
[\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B agmemx
records beliefs and observations under the domain of a resolved directory.
The normative text is
.BR "agmemx help" .
This manual lists the same commands and does not change their meaning.
.PP
Global options come before the command.
When
.B --format
is omitted, stdout that is not a terminal is json, and a terminal is text.
.PP
Hints do not run repairs.
A hint only names the next command to read.
It does not register, delete, reindex, or call an embedding provider.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B init
Create the domain for the resolved directory.
.TP
.B observe
Create one observation.
.TP
.B "belief add"
Create one belief.
.TP
.B "relation add"
Link the next utterance inside the same domain.
.TP
.B search
Search the subtree. The query is an argument. Stdin is not read.
.TP
.B config
Show or save embedding defaults. With no flags the provider is ollama and the model is nomic-embed-text.
.TP
.B "domain attach"
Replace the membership index.
.TP
.B "embed reindex"
Rebuild the cache for the current provider and model.
.TP
.B help
Show the catalog, a command,
.IR concepts ,
or
.IR usecases .
.B "agmemx help"
with no topic prints the catalog.
.TP
.B schema
Show the shape of the machine-readable JSON.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --dir \fIPATH\fR
Resolved directory.
When omitted, the process working directory at startup is used.
.TP
.B --format \fIjson|text\fR
Output format.
json writes one JSON object to stdout.
text writes a short human summary, and rejections go to stderr.
.TP
.B --embed-provider \fINAME\fR
Embedding provider:
.IR ollama ,
.IR openai ,
or
.IR fixture .
.TP
.B --embed-model \fINAME\fR
Model name.
Required for every provider.
.TP
.B --embed-base-url \fIURL\fR
Provider base URL.
The default for ollama is http://127.0.0.1:11434.
The default for openai is https://api.openai.com/v1.
.TP
.B --embed-api-key-env \fINAME\fR
Environment variable that holds the API key.
The openai default is
.BR OPENAI_API_KEY .
Unused by ollama and fixture.
.TP
.B --embed-fixture \fIPATH\fR
Fixture vector file.
Required when the provider is fixture.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
success
.TP
.B 1
domain rejection
.TP
.B 2
usage rejection
.PP
Exit 0 is success.
Exit 1 is a domain rejection.
Exit 2 is a usage rejection, including an unknown command, flag, or JSON shape.
Help does not open the store or call an embedding provider.
.SH SEE ALSO
The normative text is
.BR "agmemx help" .
Hints do not run repairs.
